 "remarks": "Welcome to 7 Peaceful Lane, a beautifully renovated turnkey home tucked away on a quiet cul-de-sac in Norwalk's desirable Wolfpit neighborhood. Thoughtfully renovated from top to bottom, this exceptional residence offers the rare opportunity to move in and enjoy without the projects, renovations, or to-do list. The home has been comprehensively updated, including a completely refreshed interior, stylish modern kitchen and bath, new systems, lighting, flooring, doors, trim, and thoughtfully designed outdoor living spaces. Every improvement has been completed with care and attention to detail, creating a home that is fresh, polished, and ready for its next owner. There is truly nothing left to do but unpack and enjoy. Ideally located just minutes from shopping, restaurants, parks, major commuting routes, and the train, 7 Peaceful Lane seamlessly combines the ease of turnkey living with privacy and everyday convenience.",
